Description: Zovelis OS system identity and secure defaults
 This package contains the parts of Zovelis OS that sit below the desktop:
  * the operating system identity (/etc/os-release names Zovelis OS; the
    Debian original is kept through a dpkg diversion),
  * kernel and network hardening settings (sysctl),
  * automatic security update policy (no automatic reboots, old kernels
    cleaned up, metered connections respected),
  * a small system log and compressed swap in RAM (zram),
  * boot menu defaults (name, other operating systems listed),
  * the Flathub application repository for sandboxed apps.
 .
 The firewall (ufw) and AppArmor are pulled in as dependencies; the Zovelis
 OS image switches the firewall on during the image build.
